[{"id":3988129663,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ttgd_","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e6d5e532e99c9e3765a102cd5a85330da39b78b3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"Approving on principle. I believe the feedback we've gotten since the initial change has made clear, that the current defaults cause more friction.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117464#pullrequestreview-3988129663","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117464","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-22T13:14:09Z"},{"id":3991479708,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7t6SWc","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e6d5e532e99c9e3765a102cd5a85330da39b78b3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"I've felt the annoyance this fixes.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117464#pullrequestreview-3991479708","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117464","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-23T12:46:03Z"},{"id":3991626250,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7t62IK","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e6d5e532e99c9e3765a102cd5a85330da39b78b3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"Makes sense to me too.\n\nIn general I feel actions with an extra modifier (here Shift) should be the more complex/least obvious actions, and I think this PR corrects this.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117464#pullrequestreview-3991626250","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117464","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-23T13:10:56Z"},{"id":3993123411,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7uAjpT","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e6d5e532e99c9e3765a102cd5a85330da39b78b3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"> basically undoing the changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90723\n\nNote that this does not undo https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90723 , previously the behavior was that tab and enter did different actions, that PR made them the same, and this PR doesn't change that. This PR just swaps the shortcut that shift is needed for.\n\nLike I mentioned here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101306#issuecomment-2797420403 , #90723 changed the behavior to match VSCode but VSCode has different behavior for different languages. For GDScript, the default is actually insert.\n\nI agree that insert is usually more expected than replace too.\nTested, works as expected.\n\nIn a future PR, we should also consider adding a message to the bottom of the completion box to show the shortcuts, so it is always clear.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117464#pullrequestreview-3993123411","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117464","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-23T16:46:45Z"},{"id":3994294960,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7uFBqw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e6d5e532e99c9e3765a102cd5a85330da39b78b3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117464#pullrequestreview-3994294960","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117464","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-23T19:54:49Z"}]